39. :damage ed -- Damages the player
40. :grav ed -- Sets the player&apos;s gravity to normal
41. :setgrav ed 100 -- Sets the player&apos;s gravity
42. :nograv ed -- Makes the player have 0 gravity
43. :health ed 1337 -- Changes the player&apos;s health
44. :speed ed 1337 -- Changes the player&apos;s walkspeed
45. :name ed potato -- Changes the player&apos;s name
46. :unname ed -- Remove the player&apos;s name
47. :team ed Raiders -- Changes the player&apos;s team
48. :stopmusic -- Will stop all music playing in the server
49. :teleport ed potato -- Teleports the player
50. :change ed kills 1337 -- Changes a player&apos;s stat
51. :kick ed -- Removes the player from the game
52. :infect ed -- Turns the player into a zombie
53. :rainbowify ed -- Turns the player into a rainbow
54. :flashify ed -- Turns the player into a strobe
55. :noobify ed -- Turns the player into a noob
56. :ghostify ed -- Turns the player into a ghost
57. :goldify ed -- Turns the player into gold
58. :shiny ed -- Makes the player shiny
59. :normal ed -- Puts the player back to normal
60. :trippy ed -- Spams random colors on the player&apos;s screen
61. :untrippy ed -- Untrippys the player
62. :strobe ed -- Spams white and black on the player&apos;s screen
63. :unstrobe ed -- Unstrobes the player
64. :blind ed -- Blinds the player
65. :unblind ed -- Unblinds the player
66. :guifix ed -- Will fix trippy/strobe/blind on a player
67. :fling ed -- Flings the player
68. :seizure ed -- Puts the player in a seizure
69  :music 1337 -- Plays a sound from the ID
70. :lock ed -- Locks the player
71. :unlock ed -- Unlocks the player
72. :removelimbs ed -- Removes the player&apos;s limbs
73. :jail ed -- Puts the player in a jail
74. :unjail ed -- Removes the jail from the player
75. :fix -- This will fix the lighting to it&apos;s original settings
76. :fly ed -- Makes the player fly
77. :unfly ed -- Removes fly from the player
78. :noclip ed -- Makes the player able to noclip
79. :clip ed -- Removes noclipping from the player
80. :pm ed Hey bro -- Sends the player a private message
