82. :undog ed -- Turns the player back to normal
83. :creeper ed -- Turns the player into a creeper
84. :uncreeper ed -- Turns the player back to normal
85. :place ed 1337 -- Sends a teleporation request to a player to go to a different place
86. :char ed 261 -- Will make a player look like a different player ID
87. :unchar ed -- Will return the player back to normal
88. :h Hello People -- This will shout a hint to everyone
89. :rank ed 109373 -- Will show up a message with the person&apos;s Role and Rank in a group
90. :starttools ed -- Will give the player starter tools
91. :sword ed -- Will give the player a sword
92. :bighead ed -- Will make the player&apos;s head larger than normal
